            "accordion_row_QyVzMt": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is a Founding Membership?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_MDjJFa": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Founding Members will be first in line to choose their seats, access exclusive member benefits, and be part of New Jersey MLS NEXT Pro from day one.</p><p>One deposit reserves one seat. If you're looking to secure multiple seats, place a deposit for each individually. Membership pricing and inventory are still being determined, and you'll be contacted with full details ahead of the general public on-sale.</p><p>Founding Members receive the following benefits: </p><ul><li>Priority seat selection (Select your season seat location before the general public.<br/>Priority numbers will be assigned based on purchase date and time)</li><li>Founding scarf</li><li>Venue recognition</li><li>Pre-launch member event(s)</li><li>Founding Member Club</li></ul>",
